of stream je muziek vanaf je smartphone of tablet.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"305\" data-end=\"417\">Het compacte en strakke ontwerp maakt deze speler geschikt voor gebruik in huis, op kantoor of in de slaapkamer.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"419\" data-end=\"422\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"424\" data-end=\"435\">Staat</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"436\" data-end=\"464\"><strong data-start=\"436\" data-end=\"464\">Zo Goed Als Nieuw (ZGAN)</strong></p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"466\" data-end=\"469\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"471\" data-end=\"486\">⭐ Voordelen</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"487\" data-end=\"652\">\r\n<li data-start=\"487\" data-end=\"520\">\r\n<p data-start=\"489\" data-end=\"520\">📻 DAB+ en FM radio-ontvangst</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"521\" data-end=\"551\">\r\n<p data-start=\"523\" data-end=\"551\">🔊 Helder en zuiver geluid</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"552\" data-end=\"592\">\r\n<p data-start=\"554\" data-end=\"592\">📱 Bluetooth voor draadloos streamen</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"593\" data-end=\"623\">\r\n<p data-start=\"595\" data-end=\"623\">🖥️ Overzichtelijk display</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"624\" data-end=\"652\">\r\n<p data-start=\"626\" data-end=\"652\">🎛️ Eenvoudige bediening</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"654\" data-end=\"657\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"659\" data-end=\"679\">📋 Specificaties</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"680\" data-end=\"890\">\r\n<li data-start=\"680\" data-end=\"698\">\r\n<p data-start=\"682\" data-end=\"698\">Merk: Albrecht</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"699\" data-end=\"716\">\r\n<p data-start=\"701\" data-end=\"716\">Model: DR 890</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"717\" data-end=\"751\">\r\n<p data-start=\"719\" data-end=\"751\">Type: DAB+ radio / mediaspeler</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"752\" data-end=\"775\">\r\n<p data-start=\"754\" data-end=\"775\">Ontvangst: DAB+, FM</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"776\" data-end=\"805\">\r\n<p data-start=\"778\" data-end=\"805\">Connectiviteit: Bluetooth</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"806\" data-end=\"821\">\r\n<p data-start=\"808\" data-end=\"821\">Display: Ja</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"822\" data-end=\"861\">\r\n<p data-start=\"824\" data-end=\"861\">Gebruik: Radio & draadloos streamen</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"862\" data-end=\"890\">\r\n<p data-start=\"864\" data-end=\"890\">Staat: Zo Goed Als Nieuw</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"892\" data-end=\"895\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"897\" data-end=\"915\">📦 Meegeleverd</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"916\" data-end=\"953\">\r\n<li data-start=\"916\" data-end=\"935\">\r\n<p data-start=\"918\" data-end=\"935\">Albrecht DR 890</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"936\" data-end=\"953\">\r\n<p data-start=\"938\" data-end=\"953\">Voedingskabel</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"955\" data-end=\"958\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"960\" data-end=\"984\">🛡️ Incl. Garantie</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"985\" data-end=\"1023\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\"><strong data-start=\"985\" data-end=\"1023\" data-is-last-node=\"\">Incl. Garantie: 3 maanden garantie</strong></p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start\"> </div>\r\n<div class=\"mt-3 w-full empty:hidden\">\r\n<div class=\"text-center\"> </div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</article>\r\n</div>",
